#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Dit is die oproepvolume vir elke uitvoer. Die vlak word outomaties toegepas "
"wanneer ’n oproep verbind en wanneer die uitvoer tydens ’n oproep verander, "
"en veranderings aan die skuifbalk word dadelik gehoor. Die hardeware pas "
"vlakke in growwe stappe toe, en die oorstuk word nooit heeltemal stil nie. "
"Die Bluetooth-vlak word gestoor vir komende roeteringsondersteuning."

